<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TRANS-NATAL HALF YR SHR, DIV JUMP.</title>
<headline>TRANS-NATAL HALF YR SHR, DIV JUMP.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     169.6	 vs 113.2</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 53.3	  vs 37.3</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   178.2	 vs 117.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   549.5	 vs 379.8</p>
<p>    Tax			 203.1	 vs 151.7</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   8.5	   vs 21.1</p>
<p>    Sales revenue	   2,284.2     vs 1,892.9</p>
<p>    Cost of sales	   1,609.3     vs 1,388.5</p>
<p>Div payable March 20</p>
<p>on register February 28</p>
<p>Full name: Trans-Natal Coal Corp Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company owns 51.46 percent of Ingwe Coal Corp Ltd</p>
<p>as its only asset.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
